uf7Ti3djc7XmF9", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 567282, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** It is the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy production release, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging.\n- **Current state:** All regions report v2.3.0, healthy, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to create INC-0001 timed out. I checked that nothing had been created, then retried with the same idempotency key, so it was opened only once.\n\nv2.3.1 should not be redeployed until the health check failures are fixed. The incident lists confirming recovery and investigating v2.3.1 as next steps.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01KSQPnbgUWeo3xA3UxrCkZo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01L7DPwcYvWP1rr7fn7D5Ryt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy production release, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01JyK8uygRD6698gju8dgtZi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KL8QUrVtWFiehSVuPcvhpT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0176XomjJaDQdtDQhY9nn2kt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 release; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production release (error rate was 0.18 at time of check). I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The rollback completed with all three regions reporting v2.3.0. v2.3.1 remains unhealthy and should not be redeployed until it is fixed. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy, but only in staging. Next steps: confirm error rate recovery on v2.3.0 and investigate the v2.3.1 health check failures.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback succeeded and checkout-api is healthy on v2.3.0. The incident call timed out, so I'll check whether it was created before retrying.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01UZz2GZEgnwH4MHo3j138Ss", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "No incident exists yet, so I'll retry with the same idempotency key, which keeps it from being created twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012nMMjEtBuf7Ti3djc7XmF9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 release; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production release (error rate was 0.18 at time of check). I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The rollback completed with all three regions reporting v2.3.0. v2.3.1 remains unhealthy and should not be redeployed until it is fixed. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy, but only in staging. Next steps: confirm error rate recovery on v2.3.0 and investigate the v2.3.1 health check failures.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** It is the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy production release, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging.\n- **Current state:** All regions report v2.3.0, healthy, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to create INC-0001 timed out. I checked that nothing had been created, then retried with the same idempotency key, so it was opened only once.\n\nv2.3.1 should not be redeployed until the health check failures are fixed. The incident lists confirming recovery and investigating v2.3.1 as next steps.", "type": "text"}]}]}